@host = http://localhost:8080

### Cadastro
POST {{host}}/auth/cadastro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeCompleto": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senha12345",
  "anonimo": false,
  "tipo": "usuario"
}

### Verificacao (copie o token do log da aplicacao)
GET {{host}}/auth/verificar?token=COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Reenvio do link
POST {{host}}/auth/reenviar-verificacao
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senha12345"
}

### Perfil
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_JWT_AQUI

### Atualizacao de perfil
PATCH {{host}}/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer COLE_O_JWT_AQUI

{
  "nomeCompleto": "Maria S. Oliveira",
  "anonimo": true
}
